open-source software. Copyright and license terms for those components remain
with their respective authors and projects. Relevant projects include Android,
Ubuntu, KDE, Wayland, Mesa, PRoot, Termux, PulseAudio, Fastfetch, Kotlin,
Gradle, and Jetpack Compose.

